  "intro": "<p>Gluco Care is a dietary supplement combining a broad blend of botanical extracts, vitamins, and minerals marketed to support healthy blood sugar levels. Its formula centers on ingredients such as Gymnema sylvestre, bitter melon, banaba leaf, and white mulberry leaf — botanicals with a long history of traditional use for glucose support, alongside more mixed clinical evidence. For people managing prediabetes or type 2 diabetes, a product like this is best understood as a complementary addition alongside diet, exercise, and prescribed medications, not a replacement for any of them.</p>\n",
