      "heading": "Dosage and How to Use Gluco Care Natural Diabetes Supplement for Blood Sugar",
      "body": "<p>According to the product's own label, the suggested use is straightforward: adults take one capsule daily with food. This is a single, fixed serving \u2014 there is no titration schedule or multi-week ramp-up described by the manufacturer. Any dosing protocol beyond what the label states (for example, splitting doses across the day or gradually increasing amount) is not something the manufacturer has published guidance on.</p>\n<h4 class=\"tbl-title\">Label-Stated Directions</h4>\n<div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"md-table\"><thead><tr><th class=\"tbl-th\">Instruction</th><th class=\"tbl-th\">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"tbl-row-even\"><td class=\"tbl-td\">Suggested use</td><td class=\"tbl-td\">One capsule daily, with food</td></tr><tr class=\"tbl-row-odd\"><td class=\"tbl-td\">Maximum</td><td class=\"tbl-td\">Do not exceed the recommended dose</td></tr><tr class=\"tbl-row-even\"><td class=\"tbl-td\">Age restriction</td><td class=\"tbl-td\">Not for use under 18, or if pregnant or nursing</td></tr><tr class=\"tbl-row-odd\"><td class=\"tbl-td\">On medication</td><td class=\"tbl-td\">Consult a physician before use, especially if taking any medication</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"tbl-source\">Source: product label (see ingredient image above)</p>\n<p>The label's own caution is worth repeating directly: it specifically advises consulting a physician before use if you are taking a medication or have a medical condition \u2014 language that applies directly to most people managing prediabetes or type 2 diabetes.</p>\n<p><strong>Action Tip</strong>: Take with food as directed, and don't exceed one capsule daily unless your doctor advises otherwise.</p>\n",
